flowchart LR
 _Prelude_(["Bypass the security team and blast your way into the mobster&#39;s vault."])
 _A1_(["After pulling up to the property, half the team exits the van while the rest stays hidden."])
 _A1_1_(["Engineer fakes an argument with the others about this being the wrong address."])
 _A1_2_(["A burly security guard emerges from her post and tells the team to leave."])
 _A1_C1_{"Muscle discreetly points a gun at the guard as his teammates loom menacingly."}
 _A1_C1F_["The guard manages to slap the gun away and land a punch on Muscle."]
 _A1_3_(["A brawl breaks out but the guard prevails and dashes toward her security post."])
 _A1_C2_{"Picklock #1 and Picklock #2 bolt out of the van, chasing down the guard."}
 _A1_C2F_["The guard escapes their grip and manages to send an alert message, calling for backup."]
 _A1_4_(["The team calls in its hacker to disable the alert attempt."])
 _A1_C3_{"Hacker breaks into the system, attempting to flag the alert as a routine drill."}
 _A1_C3P_["The alert is marked as a false alarm before any additional security personnel arrive."]
 _A1_7_(["The guard is beaten unconscious and thrown into the back of the team&#39;s van."])
 _A2_(["Hacker strips the guard with Picklock #1&#39;s help and dons her uniform."])
 _A2_1_(["Dressed the part, Hacker heads to the guard post to open the main entrance."])
 _A2_C1_{"Hacker accesses the terminal and installs a virus onto the security system."}
 _A2_C1F_["The security system detects the virus, updating itself in response to the intrusion."]
 _A2_C2_{"Picklock #1 approaches the entrance and tries to pick the lock by hand."}
 _A2_C2P_["The lock disengages, allowing Picklock #1 to step through the revolving doors."]
 _A3_(["The team enters the property, remaining alert to danger."])
 _A3_Cont_(["Hacker checks the console to see if any alarms were triggered, finding nothing."])
 _A3_1_(["As the crew scales the staircase, a patrolling guard catches them unawares."])
 _A3_2_(["Muscle tackles the guard before he can react, securing his wrists with Zip Ties."])
 _A3_3_(["Spotting a second guard, they force him to drop to the floor at gunpoint."])
 _A3_C1_{"Muscle approaches the nervous guard with zip ties at the ready."}
 _A3_C1P_["The guard tries to resist but Muscle overpowers and restrains him."]
 _A4_(["Muscle finds the door to the vault locked, requiring a keycard to open."])
 _A4_Cont_(["Picklock #1 pats down the two guards to see if either has an access card."])
 _A4_1_(["A keycard for the vault is found in the second guard&#39;s pocket."])
 _A4_2_(["Picklock #1 swipes the card in the card reader and the door slides open."])
 _A4_2_Cont_(["The team strolls through and gasps in awe as they reach the ancient vault."])
 _A4_3_(["Engineer examines the concrete frame around the vault, looking for weak spots."])
 _A4_C1_{"Engineer sets up the Core Drill and bores a hole for the explosive charge."}
 _A4_C1P_["The drill punches through the concrete easily, leaving a neat cylindrical hollow behind."]
 _A5_C1_{"Bomber steps forward, carefully placing a Shaped Charge into the cavity."}
 _A5_C1P_["The team steps back and detonates the charge, making the vault door sag from its hinges."]
 _A6_(["With the locking bolts snapped from the weight, the team pulls the door open with ease."])
 _A6_C1_{"Picklock #2 approaches the center safe, manipulating the dial with careful precision."}
 _A6_C1P_["With a gratifying click, the safe creaks open, revealing huge stacks of cash."]
 _A7_(["Picklock #2 loots the safe of its contents, dumping the cash in a duffel bag."])
 _A7_1_(["Picklock #1 uses eenie, meenie, miny, moe to select the next safe to target."])
 _A7_C1_{"Plumping for the last safe on the right, Picklock #1 gets to work."}
 _A7_C1F_["Picklock #1&#39;s technique deserts him and the safe remains clamped shut."]
 _A7_C2_{"In a mocking tone, Picklock #2 offers to help do his job for him."}
 _A7_C2F_["Despite their efforts, the safe continues to resist, its treasures out of reach."]
 _B7_3_(["Picklock #1 moves on to another safe, hoping for better luck."])
 _B7_C1_{"Picklock #1 turns the dials, coaxing the safe to reveal its secrets."}
 _B7_C1F_["The safe refuses to budge, leaving Picklock #1 stumped."]
 _B7_4_(["Picklock #1 and Picklock #2 work together to tackle another safe."])
 _B7_5_(["This time, their efforts are successful and the steel door swings open."])
 _B8_1_(["The team wastes no time snatching up the piles of dusty cash."])
 _B8_2_(["Watching from the guard post, Hacker sees a vibration alert on the monitor."])
 _B8_3_(["Hacker fails to disable the alert, with a full building lockdown now imminent!"])
 _B8_4_(["Hacker calls the team to report the situation, telling them to haul ass."])
 _B8_5_(["As the team exits, a guard trips Engineer and traps him in a scissor hold!"])
 _B8_6_(["Several teammates rush to help, only to be trapped as the lockdown completes."])
 _B8_6_Cont_(["With the security door unbreachable, Bomber and Muscle slip away."])
 _B8_7_(["Seeing only two teammates exit, Hacker realizes the rest are locked inside."])
 _B8_C1_{"Hacker deploys a hack to bypass the lockdown protocol and free his teammates."}
 _B8_C1F_["Hacker&#39;s hacking attempts fail, leaving half of the team trapped!"]
 _B8S2_(["With no other options, the remaining members grab their share of the loot and depart."])
 _A1_C1P_["The guard stops protesting and asks the team what they want."]
 _A1_5_(["Muscle strikes her with the gun&#39;s butt and the team hauls her into the van."])
 _A3_C1F_["Muscle struggles with the uncooperative guard and he breaks loose."]
 _A3_C2_{"Losing patience, Muscle pulls out his gun and demands compliance."}
 _A3_C2P_["Paralyzed by fear, the guard allows the team to restrain him without further complaint."]
 _A4_C1F_["Engineer applies too much force and the core bit becomes wedged in the concrete."]
 _A4_C2_{"Muscle works with Engineer to pry the drill bit free."}
 _A4_C2P_["The drill is worked loose, allowing Engineer to finish boring the charge hole."]
 _A5_C1F_["The team retreats and Bomber triggers the detonator but nothing happens."]
 _A5_C2_{"Engineer and Bomber inspect the wiring to look for flaws."}
 _A5_C2P_["After fixing a loose wire, the charge is detonated, dropping the door on one side."]
 _B6_(["With its locking mechanism damaged, the vault door is easy to pull open."])
 _B6_Cont_(["With his hearing returning after the blast, Picklock #2 approaches one of the safes."])
 _B6_C1_{"Picklock #2 leans in and twists the dial slowly, his hearing now clear."}
 _B6_C1P_["With a reassuring clink, the safe unlocks and the door swings ajar."]
 _B7_(["The crew eagerly helps itself to the safe&#39;s valuable contents."])
 _B7_2_(["Picklock #1 scans the room and picks out another safe at random."])
 _A1_C2P_["They manage to intercept the guard, stopping her from alerting her colleagues."]
 _A1_6_(["The guard is subdued with punches before being tossed into the back of the van."])
 _A2_C2F_["Picklock #1&#39;s actions activate the building&#39;s security system, sounding an alarm."]
 _A2_3_(["A guard emerges to check on the source of the disturbance."])
 _A2_C3_{"Picklock #1 cries for help, claiming Hacker is having a heart attack."}
 _A2_C3P_["The guard falls for the ruse and steps out, letting Picklock #1 wedge the door open."]
 _A2_7_(["The team ambushes the guard and kicks him to the floor until he&#39;s rendered unconscious."])
 _A2_8_(["Picklock #1 and Picklock #2 haul the guard to the van and dump him inside."])
 _A6_C1F_["With Picklock #2 near deaf from the earlier blast, he can&#39;t hear the dial clicks."]
 _A6_C2_{"Engineer joins in to help, following Picklock #2&#39;s precise instructions."}
 _A6_C2F_["Their efforts lack coordination, leaving the safe stubbornly locked shut."]
 _A6_1_(["With time slipping away, Picklock #2 turns his attention to another safe."])
 _B7_C1P_["The door springs open and Picklock #1 whoops with delight."]
 _B8_(["The safe is stripped bare as bundles of cash fill the gang&#39;s duffel bag."])
 _B6_C1F_["A crunching noise reveals the mechanism is damaged, preventing the safe from opening."]
 _B6_1_(["Ever more frustrated, Picklock #2 proceeds to try and crack another safe."])
 _B6_2_(["This one opens easily, leaving Picklock #2 both relieved and annoyed."])
 _B7_1_(["Ready with a duffel bag, the team swiftly strips the safe of cash and valuables."])
 _A2_C1P_["Hacker&#39;s virus induces a controlled system overload, disengaging the lock."]
 _B8_C1P_["Hacker cracks the system, releasing the door and allowing the team to escape."]
 _B8S1_(["Reunited outside the building, the team loads the loot into the van and drives off."])
 _A6_C2P_["With a final turn, the safe cracks open."]
 _A7_C1P_["Picklock #1&#39;s keen ear has the safe unlocked in no time."]
 _A8_(["Stacks of cash are bundled into the team’s duffel bag, adding to their haul."])
 _A8_1_(["Meanwhile, a video call comes into the guard post inquiring about the sudden blast sound."])
 _A8_2_(["Hacker tries to bluff but is quickly exposed, triggering a lockdown procedure."])
 _A8_3_(["With the timer counting down, Hacker alerts the team, urging them to get out."])
 _A8_4_(["Engineer and Picklock #2 ignore the threat and begin cracking another safe."])
 _A8_C1_{"Hacker tries to hack into the security system to buy the team more time."}
 _A8_C1F_["Hacker can&#39;t stop the lockdown as the timer races ominously toward zero."]
 _A8_8_(["Engineer and Picklock #2 give up and go to leave but are blocked by the bound guards."])
 _A8_9_(["Time running out, they desperately search for an alternative exit."])
 _A8_10_(["Engineer decks a guard and bolts but Picklock #2 is held up after being winded."])
 _A8_11_(["As Engineer exits, Picklock #2 struggles to keep up and is trapped by the lockdown."])
 _A10S_(["With one fewer crewmate to share the loot, the team enters the van and tears away."])
 _A7_C2P_["In a combined effort, Picklock #2 and Picklock #1 manage to crack the safe."]
 _A8_C1P_["Hacker unlocks the nearby elevator to give the team a shorter route to the exit."]
 _A8_5_(["Engineer and Picklock #2 give up and go to leave but are held up by the security door."])
 _A8_6_(["As Engineer pulls out the keycard, the bound guards charge forward to block them."])
 _A8_7_(["Engineer and Picklock #2 wrestle past the guards, paving their way to freedom."])
 _A9S_(["With seconds to spare, the team escapes, hearts racing as they vanish with their loot."])
 _A5_C2F_["Once more, the charge fails to detonate, frustration building within the team."]
 _A5_(["As they inspect the wiring again, the charge detonates in their faces!"])
 _A5F_(["With half the team maimed, the mission is abandoned in favor of a trip to the hospital."])
 _A3_C2F_["The guard feigns obedience before making a break for it."]
 _A3_4_(["In a moment of panic, Muscle fires upon the guard, blasting a hole in his back."])
 _A3_5_(["The team quickly searches the injured guard for his vault pass."])
 _A3_6_(["Amid the chaos, the other guard manages to call for backup on his radio."])
 _A3_7_(["Reinforcements quickly swarm in, sealing off the team&#39;s only exit!"])
 _A3F_(["Faced with execution, the team wisely chooses to surrender to the mobster&#39;s guards."])
 _A1_C3F_["Hacker can&#39;t halt the alert as the security team signals its imminent arrival."]
 _A1F_(["Unsure of how many guards are coming, the team decides to cut its losses and flee."])
 _A4_C2F_["The core bit remains stuck, preventing the vault from being breached."]
 _A4_4_(["The team begins to argue as it becomes clear the mission is a bust."])
 _A4F_(["With nothing to be gained from staying, the team packs up and leaves empty-handed."])
 _A2_C3F_["Picklock #1&#39;s story fails to convince the guard, who draws his gun."]
 _A2_4_(["When he commands Picklock #1 to get down, his colleague in the van awakens."])
 _A2_5_(["As Muscle struggles to control her, the other guard rushes to investigate."])
 _A2_6_(["Upon seeing his battered friend escape, the guard becomes enraged."])
 _A2F_(["Picklock #1 is mercilessly beaten as the others race away to avoid the same fate."])

